00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,158
Step three.

2
00:00:01,158 --> 00:00:06,770
A base, hydrogen sulphate ion, pulls off a hydrogen from the neighbouring carbon.

3
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:13,059
The electrons from that carbon hydrogen bond swing in to form the second bond between the two carbons.

4
00:00:13,059 --> 00:00:13,880
Ethene.

